=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ed82264dbb22dc8911270d65b507fb3, https://si.imgix.net/6764ff98/uploads/origins/2cc30349-0769-443a-9fc6-456cec7352a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b23a6f23d20dc8fd45f924a852a60ae6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6764ff98/uploads/origins/2cc30349-0769-443a-9fc6-456cec7352a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=100ff9b7507dca7221e09d64a67fe4c0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "前回はとってもかわいいサーヤを描いていただきありがとうございました！\nまたお願いしたくて誰を描いてもらおうかとても悩んだのですが、せっかくなので私のオリキャラをリクエストさせてください。（仕事では猫をかぶっているメイドです）\n今回も細部はきりしまさんにお任せしますので、自由に描いてもらえると嬉しいです！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1ixr7QMhsz5Asp9aNZ7VwPX0oFz897N0o/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@odaizinine/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d87cd82a/requests/295152_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9bcb435e207d4dc62f13348c9205489f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d87cd82a/requests/295152_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9bcb435e207d4dc62f13348c9205489f, https://si.imgix.net/d87cd82a/requests/295152_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06dc7c85303b090b61e10f03304ab0e2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d87cd82a/requests/295152_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c001bbd65cd217a09b1b0ff7dca0254 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "She's a very excitable ball of energy who loves to have fun and be active. She's got a thing for fire but is very childish and really just wants to play around and fight. You can have artistic freedom on pose, outfit, expression, everything. Please have fun to your hearts content. Thank you!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/2fb8wh4fks8?edit=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@odaizinine/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.i